近い】\n「……くすぐったいでしょ〜？　そろそろ起きなさ〜い？」\n「こちょこちょこちょこちょ〜♪」\n「こちょこちょっ……こ〜ちょこちょこちょこちょこちょ〜♪」\n\n【位置:真ん中　距離:普通】\n「……ん、起きたね？」\n「全くもぅ。キミ、私にイタズラされるの好きだよねぇ」\n「寝たフリでしょ？　い・つ・も・の♪」\n「そういうとこ、ほんっと可愛いんだからぁ」\n「だったら次は……も〜っとすごいイタズラ、しちゃおっかな？　ふふふふっ♪」\n\n〜〜〜〜〜〜\n\n以上です。\nよろしくお願いします！", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sute92/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1225492, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/fcc54699-695a-4b2c-932c-102965012ce1?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1781884952&Signature=Q4OlhomLSsS0oXDQG2bf5Majs~UYEI5IIZwbMLRsXSTVtcXOVqTyGqL07qLNHt7Y~FxGOe1QuD6M24S67MdtwfVmiY5NYsZn2dklHD5wo9gdyUrtZaGKF1xQFaCKaQjgLfRS6QnU0jbpUloLv-PEPm7bAwymnB1qMQBLt~qy~fsT7QnSnPFFC8~uxv7FtMFG5xnjUuuajVkqORUhlIWwW2CBmb6ONjd~IU9obX3yENKTWuLbLJAA8TAyDRjDFwJqd9WvfQt~NuVmSdCTp34KlaY29a0i-YadG~uYsm41g5md25DxIWlQD-h5YPzhRqI7s-xhQo-naBwMlzI7uLOayw__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1695757533292761088%2FfHtjDuC0.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c235bc07757db28ef70b280131c7f545", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1695757533292761088%2FfHtjDuC0.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c235bc07757db28ef70b280131c7f545, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1695757533292761088%2FfHtjDuC0.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62c0e7f386b3adf4ec336a63b8489248 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1695757533292761088%2FfHtjDuC0.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27276363ca954cc9d7ed9e9115e2e7ad 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads